; EDAS - X1 target, TOSR edition (reloc stage 2).
;
; The same EDAS source (src/edas.z80) with EDAS_TOSR
; defined: the RELOC directive is enabled, and a source
; that heads with RELOC assembles to a complete TOSR v1
; relocatable file (self-relocation stub + bitmap +
; trailer) instead of a plain binary. Sources without
; RELOC assemble exactly as with the standard edition.
; The standard edition (src/edas.z80 assembled as-is) is
; unchanged; this edition is a separate binary.
; Assemble from the tapeos/ directory (INCLUDE is
; CWD-relative).

EDAS_TOSR       equ     1

        include "src/edas.z80"
